"""Hotel platform GraphQL API — designed from frontend product flows (see docs/graphql-api.md).

The API contract is split per module under graphql/<module>/*.graphqls; this
root file only declares the schema skeleton, scalars and the empty Query /
Mutation roots that each module extends.
"""
schema {
	query: Query
	mutation: Mutation
}

scalar LocalDate
scalar DateTime

type Query

type Mutation